{"availability":"available","full":"KXHXK/opercerta","name":"opercerta","description":"Auditable AI operations agent for inventory exceptions, equipment alerts, and human-approved workflows.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":39,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-18T10:55:54Z","updated":"2026-08-12T16:44:01Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opercerta-kxh.netlify.app","topics":["ai-agent","fastapi","langgraph","mcp","observability","postgresql","python","react"],"demo":"https://opercerta-kxh.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:35:19.852Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:35:19.852Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:35:19.852Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T21:08:44.739Z","stars":39,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:35:19.852Z","stars":39,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OperCerta is a controlled, auditable operations agent for inventory shortages, equipment incidents, and blocked operational tasks. It combines bounded LLM reasoning with deterministic policy, human approval, durable workflow state, and idempotent business writes.","Release scope: this version is a public static showcase + locally reproducible complete Agent MVP + recording. The public page does not expose the API or database. It is not a public interactive product or a production deployment. Production identity, public ingress, rate limiting, backups, high availability, and automated deployment are not implemented.","Operational systems often detect an exception before an operator knows how to resolve it. The evidence may be spread across inventory, equipment, task, and procedure systems; it may also change while approval is pending. An unrestricted agent that writes directly to those systems would create unacceptable safety and audit risks."],"features":["deterministic detectors discover bounded operational signals;","an LLM-assisted agent gathers evidence and explains a proposed action;","policy code decides whether approval is required and validates parameters;","a human approves a binding of facts, rules, and the proposed plan;","the system fetches fresh evidence before execution;"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KXHXK/opercerta/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"772d187ca5e9d5858b8c534b7e3c1bb1be58dbd54fcdb9cbe989c68787c8b2c1","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:44.891Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:44.891Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"OperCerta is a controlled, auditable operations agent for inventory shortages, equipment incidents, and blocked operational tasks. It combines bounded LLM reasoning with deterministic policy, human approval, durable workflow state, and idempotent business writes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KXHXK/opercerta/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Mock model mode is enabled by default and does not require a real API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KXHXK/opercerta/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"772d187ca5e9d5858b8c534b7e3c1bb1be58dbd54fcdb9cbe989c68787c8b2c1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KXHXK/opercerta/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:44.891Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-12T16:44:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KXHXK/opercerta/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:44.892Z","hash":"772d187ca5e9d5858b8c534b7e3c1bb1be58dbd54fcdb9cbe989c68787c8b2c1","originalBytes":14010,"storedBytes":14010,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["agent","run","recovery","evidence","api","approval","compose","opercerta","passed","docs","policy","tool","database","equipment","mcp","postgresql","safety","bounded","gate","inventory","local","model","npm","procedure","quality","task","tests","work","audit","console","deterministic","loop","operational","production","public","python","real","state","trace","web","bash